  "solution": "**Explanation : **\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b38176a914763acc7b31d5fa20076aafffccaf27357a9a59a162f6ef709fb410.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c5f3c96193418034f597e12e47fc9f3ef61b84e4ddcb8194e52816973a5b6fcb.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/40fed0c713ca4a3cf0bcc6f10815bbf55457ea225f1f9fb8a8ca0f0c8b379a8e.png] 17 - 16 = 1 , 14 - 13 = 1\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7c9449172bea336a3ed26d917efc31942179686af2bfe13192e146ab9b089617.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a20655337b903952f0064cc3d2260a5dc1881b73d1767efe6ff876ce49d4eb13.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/40fed0c713ca4a3cf0bcc6f10815bbf55457ea225f1f9fb8a8ca0f0c8b379a8e.png] 17 - 12 = 5 , 9 - 4 = 5\n\nSimilarly,\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2de9d946685ac4eafbabeafc274632b3a9edd372e22ab0e23223e84e2d197ed4.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebac1d54346cfd8e948795465b68b92b503a60b9bc35954de00e7cc9eab38eb9.png] [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/40fed0c713ca4a3cf0bcc6f10815bbf55457ea225f1f9fb8a8ca0f0c8b379a8e.png] 32 - 29 = 3 , 20 - 17 = 3\n\n**Hence, 20 is the correct answer.**",
